  "_effects": "What each fitting DOES, in the ten stats. DESIGN_V1 1.3: every fitting buys one stat and spends another - the prose `buys` and `spends` above say it in words and these say it in numbers, and migration 0074 asserts the two agree in SHAPE: everything except the figurehead has at least one positive and at least one negative effect. The figurehead is the deliberate exception (1.4): it costs no stat, only ducats, and until crew morale exists it changes nothing at all - which the row says rather than inventing an effect to look busy."
